# Build context is the `services/` workspace root.
# Keep it to source + manifests; everything below is regenerated inside the image
# or must never be shipped.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.test.ts
**/tests/
**/__tests__/
**/coverage/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/biome.json
**/README.md
.git/
